  "solution": {
    "text": "<blockquote><p>Given,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>a</mi><mi>sin</mi><mfenced><mfrac><mrow><mi>&#960;</mi><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mi>x</mi></mfenced></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>,</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#8477;</mi></math></p><p>Now given&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><munder><mi>lim</mi><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></munder><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced></math>&nbsp;exists,</p><p>So&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><munder><mi>lim</mi><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo><mo>-</mo><msup><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo></msup></mrow></munder><mi>a</mi><mi>sin</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>&#960;</mi><mfrac><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn></math></p><p>And&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><munder><mi>lim</mi><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo><mo>-</mo><msup><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo></msup></mrow></munder><mo>asin</mo><mfenced><mrow><mi>&#960;</mi><mfrac><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn></math></p><p>So,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><munder><mi>lim</mi><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></munder><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced></math>&nbsp;exist when&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>-</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></math></p><p>Now,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msubsup><mo>&#8747;</mo><mn>0</mn><mn>4</mn></msubsup><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mo>&#8747;</mo><mn>0</mn><mn>1</mn></msubsup><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><msubsup><mo>&#8747;</mo><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><msubsup><mo>&#8747;</mo><mn>2</mn><mn>3</mn></msubsup><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><msubsup><mo>&#8747;</mo><mn>3</mn><mn>4</mn></msubsup><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msubsup><mo>&#8747;</mo><mn>0</mn><mn>4</mn></msubsup><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mo>&#8747;</mo><mn>0</mn><mn>1</mn></msubsup><mo>-</mo><mi>sin</mi><mfenced><mfrac><mrow><mi>&#960;</mi><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mi>x</mi></mfenced></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><msubsup><mo>&#8747;</mo><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mo>-</mo><mi>sin</mi><mfenced><mfrac><mrow><mi>&#960;</mi><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mi>x</mi></mfenced></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><msubsup><mo>&#8747;</mo><mn>2</mn><mn>3</mn></msubsup><mo>-</mo><mi>sin</mi><mfenced><mfrac><mrow><mi>&#960;</mi><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mi>x</mi></mfenced></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><msubsup><mo>&#8747;</mo><mn>3</mn><mn>4</mn></msubsup><mo>-</mo><mi>sin</mi><mfenced><mfrac><mrow><mi>&#960;</mi><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mi>x</mi></mfenced></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mo>&#8747;</mo><mn>0</mn><mn>1</mn></msubsup><mfenced><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><msubsup><mo>&#8747;</mo><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mfenced><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></mfenced><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><msubsup><mo>&#8747;</mo><mn>2</mn><mn>3</mn></msubsup><mfenced><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><msubsup><mo>&#8747;</mo><mn>3</mn><mn>4</mn></msubsup><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></math></p></blockquote>",
